WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.600
Breathe with the circle.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.400
Bring to mind someone who hurt you.
Not the deepest wound. Just one that still aches.

3
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:15.800
Notice where you carry it.
Your chest. Your throat. Your hands.

4
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:21.000
Breathe into that place.

5
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:27.000
Forgiveness doesn't mean it was okay.

6
00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:33.000
It means you're ready to put it down.

7
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:38.800
I see the hurt. (say it silently)

8
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:44.800
I don't need to carry this anymore.

9
00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:50.200
May you be at peace.

10
00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:55.600
May I be at peace.

11
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Breathe. Let go.
